      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Latest build increased pronoun length but it still cuts mine and others' off compared to the old length. We don't use fake pronouns, it's just not enough. And keeping it in one line really obscures it, wasn't the point of the bubble in the first place so they would be more visible? I feel like the new format will just make more people ignore pronouns by default because they're so forgettable, they look even smaller than the rest of the text on the plate\n\nThese mockups with separate bubbles are really slick and I feel could still be compact enough to have some ideas integrated!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
