      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "Taking these in order: \n\npronoun truncation is improved, and the widget and banner layout is being adjusted so the widgets stop sitting on top of the group banner. \n\nGroup code and trust level visibility is a different conversation. we're not planning to give trust rank more prominence on the nameplate, though we do want the existing shield icon to be easier to read. \n\nThanks for the diagram, it made the comparison easy to follow.",
